Package: libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0
Version: @DEB_LIBGDKPIXBUF_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gdk-pixbuf
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libpng16-16, libjpeg62-turbo, libtiff5
Description: GDK Pixbuf library
 The GDK Pixbuf library provides image loading, scaling and rendering
 facilities used by GTK and other GNOME applications.
 .
 This package contains the shared library with the PNG, JPEG, GIF, TIFF and
 other image loaders built in.
